    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d219">

                <pb facs="0209" n="203" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg203"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Sir
                            Julian Pauncefote.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-02"><hi rendition="#italic">June 2,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith
                    for your information copy of a modus vivendi between the United States and
                        Russia<anchor n="*" xml:id="d219-f1"/> for the protection of fur seals in
                    and near the Russian waters of the Bering Sea and in a zone of 30 miles around
                    the Commander and Robben Islands.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
